@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
actor Operator
actor "CLI user" as CLI
actor "Web user" as Web
actor "Ollama HTTP service" as LLM
rectangle "Parallel search system" {
  usecase "UC1: Build / rebuild index\nPOST /api/index" as Index
  usecase "UC2: REST search\nPOST /api/search" as Rest
  usecase "UC3: Stream search stages\n/ws/search" as WS
  usecase "UC4: Read health and statistics\nGET /api/health, /api/stats" as Health
}
Operator --> Index
Operator --> Health
CLI --> Rest
Web --> WS
LLM -- Rest : query expansion
LLM -- WS : query expansion
note bottom of Index
  Automatic startup also prepares the local corpus
  and invokes the same index endpoint.
end note
@enduml
